  "grammar_observation": {
    "target_language": "Oes afal yma? Oes. Oes ci yn y bocs? Nac oes. Does dim ci yn y bocs. Mae afal yma. Beth sydd yn y bocs?",
    "bridge_language": "Use Oes ...? to ask whether something is present; answer Oes or Nac oes, and use Mae ... to state what is present. Treat Beth sydd yn ...? only as the fixed question shown here, not as a general relative-clause pattern."
  },
